    'Random walk': ['A path where <b>each move is independent</b> of the previous ones. H = 0.5. Prices of liquid markets are close to this most of the time.', [['H ≈ 0.5', 'random-walk-like'], ['No edge', 'in trend or reversal rules from the path alone']], 'Expect most pairs to be random-walk-like most of the time: that is normal, not a fault of the tool.'],
